# Implementation Plan — Lead Growth Enterprise SaaS Bug Fix, RBAC, UI/UX & Stability Upgrade

This plan outlines the technical changes needed to transform the Lead Growth platform into a fully functional, enterprise-grade SaaS application. All 11 Epics (E1–E11) will be systematically implemented, tested, and validated without mock code or placeholders.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **RBAC Matrix Enforcements**:
> - **Admin**: Full access to all modules, user role modification, workspace controls, system monitoring, billing, API management, and global config.
> - **Manager**: Access to User Management, Team Settings, Lead & Task Assignment, User Suspension/Reactivation for non-admins. Restricted from modifying, suspending, deleting, or altering roles of Administrators.
> - **User**: Access to Personal Settings, Assigned Tasks, Workflows, Lead updates, and Campaign work. Restricted from creating/assigning tasks, managing team users, or accessing admin settings.

> [!NOTE]
> **Design Theme Standardization**:
> Welcome Page, Auth/Login Page, Dashboard, and all application sub-views will be unified under an Enterprise SaaS palette:
> - **Primary Navy**: `#0F4C81`
> - **Secondary Cyan**: `#1D9BF0`
> - **Accent Teal**: `#00C2A8`
> - **Background Light Slate**: `#F8FAFC`
> - **Surface Card White**: `#FFFFFF`
> - **Body Text**: `#1E293B`

