## Proposed Changes

---

### Backend Service & Controller Layer (`/backend`)

#### [MODIFY] [UserService.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/service/UserService.java)
- Update `updateUserStatus`:
  - Allow Managers (in addition to Admins) to suspend and reactivate team members.
  - Enforce restriction: If target user is an Administrator (`ROLE_ADMIN`), reject suspension request if actor is a Manager or another unauthorized user.
- Update `editUserDetails`:
  - Enforce restriction: Managers cannot edit Administrator profile details.
- Update `deleteUser`:
  - Enforce restriction: Managers cannot delete Administrator accounts. Only Admins can delete users, and Admins cannot delete themselves.
- Update `updateUserRole`:
  - Enforce restriction: Only Admins can change user roles, and cannot change another Admin's role to lower unless doing an ownership transfer.

#### [MODIFY] [UserController.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/controller/UserController.java)
- Ensure all user management endpoints (`PUT /api/users/{id}/status`, `PUT /api/users/{id}/role`, `PUT /api/users/{id}/details`, `DELETE /api/users/{id}`) have proper RBAC annotations (`@PreAuthorize("hasAnyRole('ADMIN', 'MANAGER')")`) and return updated User objects or clear error responses.

#### [MODIFY] [TaskService.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/service/TaskService.java)
- Fix `createTask`:
  - Sanitize payload arguments (handle empty strings for `dueDate`, null `assignedToId`).
  - Correctly execute Assignment Engine (manual assignment, hybrid auto-assignment for ID `-1`).
  - Persist Task in MySQL, write `TaskAssignment` and `AssignmentLog`, trigger `Notification` entity generation, and broadcast via `WebSocketManager`.
- Restrict task creation to Admin and Manager.

#### [MODIFY] [TaskController.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/controller/TaskController.java)
- Ensure task endpoints enforce role permissions via `@PreAuthorize`.

#### [NEW] [SystemMonitoringController.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/controller/SystemMonitoringController.java)
- Create `/api/admin/system/metrics` endpoint accessible strictly to `ROLE_ADMIN`.
- Return live server health metrics:
  - Spring Boot Tomcat / API Status
  - HikariCP Database pool connections & status
  - Active WebSocket client connections
  - Scheduled task runner health
  - System metrics: active users count, JVM memory allocation, CPU load estimations, error log statistics from `ActivityLogRepository`.

